00:24:58.000 --> 00:25:21.000
They want to feel good about their past commitments. They want to reinforce their preconceptions. So those are all social and psychological goals that people have when they do forecasting. And forecasting tournaments are very unusual worlds. We create a world in which only one thing matters. It's pure accuracy. So at somewhat analogous to the sort of world
